<Text>&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0in; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-padding-alt: 0in 0in 1.0pt 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Automotive Radar FMCW MIMO Example&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Simulation Task&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This workspace illustrates an Automotive Radar MIMO Radar FMCW-based&amp;nbsp;(the Tx waveform in consecutive time slots) example with 4*4 MIMO radar architectures. The range, velocity and AoA (Angle Of Arrival) measurements are presented. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;Workspace Description&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-layout-grid-align: none&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;This example is based on typical 3-layer radar simulation architecture. The baseband waveform design is based on TDM-FMCW MIMO radar design, with&amp;nbsp;4 Tx channels transmitting the FMCW waveform in&amp;nbsp;consecutive&amp;nbsp;4-slot time range. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;With 4 Rx channels, the radial range, radial velocity and AoA measurements are conducted, with results compared with preset values.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In this example, MIMO Radar antenna array is placed on X-Y plane (horizontally in x-axis for 1-D antenna array radar). Targets are placed in X-Z plane, and only the azimuth angle (AoA) is measured for 1-D antenna array radar. For each target, the measurement results are proposed as:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Range: the radial distance between the antenna array center and the target in X-Z plane.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Velocity: the radial velocity between radar and the target, only the velocity in the direction from radar antenna to the target.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;AoA: &lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-spacerun: yes&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;target azimuth angle of arrival in X-Z plane.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Also after the simulation, the following diagram will be shown: &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Channel-1 Range-Doppler Spectrum Before CFAR&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Channel-1 Range-Doppler Spectrum After CFAR&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.65in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Target Positions in X-Y Coordinate (without velocity information)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: auto auto 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;The &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;Step02-RangeDoppler_Spectrum_Plot equation&lt;/B&gt; displays Range-Doppler Spectrum and &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;Step03-Target_XYCorr_Plot&lt;/B&gt; outputs target range diagrams in X-Y coordinates after the simulation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: auto auto 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.2in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;All the parameters are defined in the &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;Step01-System_Equations&lt;/B&gt; equation including:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormalCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.7in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-add-space: auto&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-font-kerning: 12.0pt&apos